status              device status
ver                 firmware version
clock               RTC time (UTC)
get                 show radio params
advert              send a flood advert
advert.zerohop      send a 0-hop advert
set name <v>        set node name
set freq <MHz>      set frequency
set bw <kHz>        set bandwidth
set sf <7-12>       set spreading factor
set cr <5-8>        set coding rate
set tx <dBm>        set TX power
wifi status|on|off|scan
wifi use <n> | set ssid <v> | set pwd <v> | apply | clear
mqtt status
tcp status|on|off
ble status|on|off
ota status|start|netdiag | ota url <https://...bin>
get|set radio2 <f,bw,sf,cr,rx|rxtx[,pre]>|off
get|set tempradio2 <f,bw,sf,cr,mode,mins>|off
get|set radioat2 / tempradioat2, del <n|all>
tempradio <f,bw,sf,cr,mins> | normalradio
get|set radio2.cross auto|on|off
get|set tx.media auto|radio|radio2|both|off
get|set tx.user key:<hex>|"name" <choice>
get|set tx.channel <slot|name> <choice>
get radio2.status | radio2.timing | mediamesh
reboot              restart the device
